      "content": "a sanctuary? it doesn't feel like that. it feels more like withdrawing into nothingness. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a world that has no room for people like me. every time i think about \"moving forward,\" i just see more of the same struggle, more of the same lies. it honestly feels like the only way to actually find peace and stop the noise is to just... stop being part of it. to just exit. is that even a reasonable thought to have?",
